#: input/pagecontent/qr_code_generation.md:172
msgid "Compress the COSE structure with ZLIB (<a0>RFC 1950</a0>) using Deflate (<a1>RFC 1951</a1>). Compression comes after signing, so the verifier decompresses before it verifies."
